      "solution": {
        "en": "<p>Let \\( x=0.\\overline{27} \\). Then \\( 100x=27.\\overline{27} \\), so \\( 99x=27 \\).</p>\\[ x=\\dfrac{27}{99}=\\dfrac{3}{11}. \\]",
